# Zorli does not currently require any environment variables.
# All tools run entirely in the browser (client-side).
#
# If you add one later:
# - Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ via import.meta.env.VITE_*
# - copy this file to `.env.local` (already gitignored) and fill it in
#VITE_EXAMPLE_KEY="example-value"
